Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:12.01,OpeningQuote,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2075,0)\pos(320,22)}There is only one rule in love:\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hbring happiness to those you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:12.01,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(775,0)\q2\pos(576,255)}Stendhal, "Journal, 19 June 1805"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:17.98,Flashback,Researcher A,0,0,0,,This is amazing, Ayanokoji-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:21.39,Flashback,Researcher A,0,0,0,,Kiyotaka-kun is an unquestioned genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:24.47,Flashback,Ayanokoji's Father,0,0,0,,Being born a genius means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:28.22,Flashback,Ayanokoji's Father,0,0,0,,Don't forget, the purpose \Nof this organization
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:32.26,Flashback,Ayanokoji's Father,0,0,0,,is to produce excellence from \Neven the most inferior DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.51,Flashback,Researcher A,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:37.48,Flashback,Ayanokoji's Father,0,0,0,,Don't show bias to him \Njust because he's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:41.69,Flashback,Ayanokoji's Father,0,0,0,,Even if that means it breaks him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:46.44,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,You surprise me, Arisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:49.33,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,You don't usually take so \Nmuch interest in things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:53.44,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Experiments to create artificial genius...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:56.06,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It's only natural that I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:58.81,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,You never change, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:01.13,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:05.21,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,Oh, that's Sensei's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.58,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,His name, I believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:11.96,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,is Ayanokoji Kiyotaka-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:16.24,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji Kiyotaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:23.22,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,We will now begin this \Nyear's final special exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:30.72,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,Each class, choose five of the presented \Nten subjects, and press "confirm."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:27.50,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\pos(45.143,145.143)\c&H89614B&\fs12\shad0\3c&HE2C3B1&\frz349.7\frx12\fry22}Final Special Exam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:34.24,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\pos(102,140)\fnArial\b1\fs18\c&H781400&\bord0\shad0}English
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:38.72,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for the day we'd do battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:43.12,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was destiny that made it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:45.85,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(102,140)\fnArial\b1\fs18\c&H781400&\bord0\shad0}English
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:47.87,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&H59002E&\bord0\shad0\pos(488,210)}English
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:47.87,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&H59002E&\bord0\shad0\pos(555,210)}Modern Lit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:47.87,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&H390608&\bord0\shad0\pos(450,308)}Math
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:47.87,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&H670422&\bord0\shad0\pos(522,316)}Mental Math
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.69,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Destiny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:52.88,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's a very abstract concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.09,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Well, I am a young maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:59.36,Main,Hoshinomiya,0,0,0,,After all that effort to \Nmake it up to Class C,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:01.73,Main,Hoshinomiya,0,0,0,,he has to face Sakayanagi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:04.19,Main,Hoshinomiya,0,0,0,,Poor Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.11,Main,Hoshinomiya,0,0,0,,I can't help but sympathize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.35,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,Just see that you remain impartial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.35,0:02:09.98,Main,Hoshinomiya,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:12.11,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:15.10,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,Let's determine the first subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:21.61,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd ask that \Nyou take it easy on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:25.34,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But I hope you'll give it \Neverything you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:29.12,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,90)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0}Round 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:41.89,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Intentionally keeping your ace, \NSudo-kun, in reserve?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:46.89,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The captains' rule for this round
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:51.89,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,lets us swap in one participant \Nat the moment of our choosing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:51.90,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(382.667,38)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H583C29&\frx0\fry4}Captains' Special Rule
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:51.90,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H583C29&\an7\pos(96.667,159.333)\fay-.042\frx4\fry0}Ability to swap out one member at chosen time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:54.02,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:17.05,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,They're doing pretty great for \Nnot having Sudo-kun in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:18.60,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:20.42,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,This seems far too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.93,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm invoking the captains' rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.20,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Swapping members.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.25,Main_Top,Sudo,0,0,0,,Great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:32.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sudo Ken swaps in for Hondo Ryotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:30.86,Main_Top,Hondo,0,0,0,,Give it your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.09,0:03:36.29,Italics,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I should have known that simple \Nstrategy wouldn't fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.69,Italics,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Just as I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:45.82,Main,Kito,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:50.08,Main,Kito,0,0,0,,Left completely helpless \Nagainst an amateur like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.75,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Damn it... You've played \Nbasketball before, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:04:00.00,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,You were going easy on us before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:04.68,Main,Kito,0,0,0,,No. You just suck that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.64,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:14.94,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The smallest of psychological blows \Nwill cause Sudo-kun to crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:19.63,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,No matter how superlative one's \Nskills, if the mind is weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:20.66,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:23.95,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,When did you get your information on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:29.70,Main,Kito,0,0,0,,Your team lost the lead after \Nyou came out, basketball club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:31.91,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Like hell! I'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.54,Main,Kito,0,0,0,,So simple-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:36.00,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Kanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.11,Main_Top,Koenji,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.11,Main,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.34,Main_Top,Wang,0,0,0,,We can still turn it around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:42.67,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,That's our Sudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.67,Main_Top,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Hey, looking cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:44.26,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Onodera-san, nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.42,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,We've still got time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:47.69,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Ike and Sudo are in total sync, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:52.68,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,The winner: Class C!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:54.41,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:56.19,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,We did it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:58.94,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:02.32,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You're suggesting he's matured, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:05.50,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:05.75,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Great job, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:07.41,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,How surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.41,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,We beat Class A!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:09.66,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,5)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs16\bord0\shad0}Final Special Exam
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:09.66,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs24\bord0\shad0\pos(225,64)\c&HF6F7F6&}3x3 Basketball
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:09.66,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:14.30,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,We've played a powerful \Ncard in Sudo-kun early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:18.17,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,Match two, typing battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:18.17,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,90)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0}Round 2
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:18.17,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\1a&HFF&\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(320,160)\b1}Typing Battle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:21.80,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Another of Class C's chosen subjects?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.02,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It appears you have the luck of the draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.93,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(675,0)\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fs24\pos(320,20)\an8\3c&H3C423E&}Round Two: Typing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:33.43,Main,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fs14\an7\3c&HBE4791&\frz341.5\fay-.03\frx342\fry334\pos(116,38)}Sotomura Hideo Class C
