Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:40.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\p1\bord0.6\c&H5B00D4&\pos(156.067,62.366)}m 0 0 l 16.5 0 l 16.5 16.5 l 0 16.5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:40.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\p1\bord0.6\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(173.467,62.366)}m 0 0 l 16.5 0 l 16.5 16.5 l 0 16.5
