Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:40.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\p1\bord0.6\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(208.267,62.366)}m 0 0 l 16.5 0 l 16.5 16.5 l 0 16.5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:40.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\p1\bord0.6\c&H5B00D4&\pos(225.667,62.366)}m 0 0 l 16.5 0 l 16.5 16.5 l 0 16.5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:40.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\p1\bord0.6\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(243.067,62.366)}m 0 0 l 16.5 0 l 16.5 16.5 l 0 16.5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:50.73,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,He's the most excellent subject here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:55.67,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,But I can't help but pity the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:57.84,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:01.99,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,He's been in this facility \Nsince the moment of his birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:03.99,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,He's never once experienced
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:06.75,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,the love of a parent or the \Nwarmth of a human touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:29.52,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(502,70)\c&H0A0C0C&\3c&H3D4143&\fs14\bord1\frx0\fry6}Captain A
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.51,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\frx0\fry0\pos(318,86)\fnTimes New Roman\c&H150E0A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1\shad0\b1}Final Special Exam Round 7
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.51,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\fnVerdana\pos(318,270)\b1\c&H360A07&\bord0\shad0\fs30}Chess
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.03,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\pos(570,238)\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord4\c&H000000&\3c&HA793A3&}Horikita Suzune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.03,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord4\an8\c&H000000&\3c&H777A78&\pos(66,126)}Hashimoto Masayoshi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:45.73,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,Let us now begin the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:04.15,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I only learned chess a few months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:06.22,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,so please take it easy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.21,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:10.15,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I only started a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:16.30,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No one can beat me when I'm not holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:17.03,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,550)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs12\c&HDCD3D2&\bord0\shad0\frz11.33\pos(287.333,110.666)}Ayanokoji Kiyotaka
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:20.45,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:22.73,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I feel like I'll win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:43.40,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Pretty twisted attack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:45.64,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Did Sakayanagi-san teach it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:50.63,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Seems like you learned from \Nsomeone pretty skilled, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:52.51,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You'll just have to speculate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:54.84,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:59.03,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Although... mind if I \Nask you about Ayanokoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:08.17,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Since the island test, I've been wondering \Nif he might be the real mastermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:10.00,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.47,0:12:12.03,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Just instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:13.50,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Could you give me an answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:15.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Give you an answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:19.00,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I don't have the slightest idea \Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.59,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:23.26,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,You seem a little flustered to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:27.18,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'd anticipated that you \Nmight try to shake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:30.79,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But that won't be enough to \Nbreak through my stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:39.40,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can afford \Nto spend this time talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:41.90,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Now it's getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:48.66,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The endgame seems sadly \Npredictable at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:51.66,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I suppose it's time I got involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:58.53,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I'd like to say I'm still in this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:01.06,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,but I'm actually pretty grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:11.23,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Is the gap in our abilities this wide?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.43,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HB1BBC0&\3c&H3D4143&\fs14\bord1\frx0\fry6\shad0\pos(301.333,62.667)\frz3.429}Captain C
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:17.91,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Not going to step in, Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:24.01,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have no choice \Nbut to go on and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:27.97,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm not strong enough for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:31.09,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:34.96,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:38.96,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(75,126)\an7\fnGeorgia\fs14\3c&H77792B&\shad0\b1\fscx85}In accordance with the\Nspecial rule, Class C's captain\Nhas joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:43.41,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,At last, we'll be able to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.97,0:13:57.98,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(570,238)\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord4\c&H000000&\3c&HA793A3&}Horikita Suzune\N{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord1\3c&H000000&}Captain C
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.97,0:13:57.98,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord4\an8\c&H000000&\3c&H777A78&\pos(66,126)}Hashimoto Masayoshi\N{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord1\3c&H000000&}Captain A
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:07.07,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:10.02,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Just how fast do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:15.09,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Our battle must appear rather pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.49,0:14:16.58,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:19.70,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,What do you think, Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:23.96,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Has my playstyle touched your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:26.54,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes, painfully so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:29.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If I made a single mistake, \Nyou'd overwhelm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:32.22,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:37.43,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I know you won't make even \Nthe smallest of mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:41.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You could give up if you wanted to, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.81,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:45.73,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,If you won't make a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:48.99,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'll just have to crush \Nyou with pure ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:58.00,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:06.25,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm sure this won't be enough to end you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:12.26,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Wait, that move...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.52,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,Listen, Arisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:25.02,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,If the children here grow \Nup into superior specimens,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:28.53,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,and facilities like these become commonplace,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:32.78,Flashback,Sakayanagi's Father,0,0,0,,I think that will be the \Nbeginning of something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.79,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:41.18,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I will stop that from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:46.02,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You really are brilliant, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.35,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I had a lot of fun with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:52.70,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It really is a shame to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.09,0:15:54.13,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.81,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,This will be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.71,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.85,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.32,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:18.91,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I don't want to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:20.33,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I want to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:23.17,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:26.46,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I can't figure out how to beat Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:30.01,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:37.10,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,This move...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:45.85,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That was brilliant, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:52.86,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,There's no doubt in my mind that an ordinary \Nperson couldn't make a play like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.19,0:16:54.47,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.87,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I have a reason why I need to win, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:02.62,Italics,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Genius must be something you're born with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:06.04,Italics,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,As the heir to truly superior DNA,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:11.63,Italics,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I will prove that facilities \Nlike that one are meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:15.30,Italics,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That is the salvation that I must provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:20.86,Italics,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,And... there's something \Nthat I must show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:23.89,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:47.38,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:48.83,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:50.98,Main,Sakagami,0,0,0,,The winner is Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:58.76,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It was a fine match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:02.43,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It could have gone either way at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:04.14,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.29,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:12.50,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That last move... Did you really make it \Nbecause you thought it would be ideal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:14.51,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why else would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:19.06,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,You're a cruel person, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:24.12,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,You could just be honest with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:26.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:32.42,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,You normally would have been \Nthe one to win that match.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:37.97,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,The move he made then was \Neven better than the one
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:40.79,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,that would have been considered ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:45.97,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Are you saying... you interfered in our test?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:53.27,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You altered Ayanokoji-kun's command to \Nchange the one Horikita-san received?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:02.74,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Why didn't you admit to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.27,0:19:10.25,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,You really think he'd reveal \Nthings he didn't have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:14.00,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,It's all your fault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:19.21,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,Because you gave Ayanokoji-kun \Nthat ridiculous protection point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:24.51,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,However... pathetic though it is, \Na victory is a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:26.53,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,Why not celebrate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:29.26,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You're skilled at provocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:32.27,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You will pay a high price for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:34.42,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,A child like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:38.03,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,That's an interesting claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:41.11,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,You're free to try what you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.82,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Just as expected, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.71,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:25.72,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You accepted that very readily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:30.22,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I lost in a replay of the same conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:32.92,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm satisfied with that result.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:35.29,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,For this special exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:40.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,you could have submitted only one-on-one \Nmatches to ensure that we fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.89,0:21:43.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:50.30,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I wanted to avoid your abilities \Nbecoming publicly known.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:53.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Consideration for me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:56.07,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:22:00.26,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I now have the answer I was seeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.53,0:22:05.19,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You are a true genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.83,0:22:08.42,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You're not simply pretending at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:15.70,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You saw me in the White Room, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.70,0:22:19.93,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I began to play chess after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:24.19,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,hoping I'd get to face you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.53,0:22:29.99,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I desperately wanted to know more about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.45,0:22:37.88,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Like a childhood friend who pined after \Nyou for years, yet never found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:41.79,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Allow me to apologize for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:43.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:47.30,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I told you the reason I wanted \Nto avoid a one-on-one,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:49.48,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,but that was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.01,0:22:53.21,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.57,0:22:58.81,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I wanted to be in the same space \Nas you for as long as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.41,0:23:06.07,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,People learn warmth through contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:09.16,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That's a very important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:21.90,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with \Nthe warmth of human contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:24.79,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Do remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:26.77,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:31.54,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That's a message from me, \Ndelivered later than I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:38.98,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Now, let's head home.
